gate: OPEN
v:4 role:dev x:frontend
task: S89 T5 — Ungroup coincident vehicles at max zoom
requires: [FRONTEND_DEV]
sprint: S89

context: |
  ClusterMapVehicleLayer sets spiderfyOnMaxZoom, which spreads a cluster
  only after a tap. Markers with the same coordinates stay one bubble at
  maximum zoom. S73 requires clustering for large fleets. Grouping off
  (groupObjects false) already draws single markers.

steps:
  1. Keep MarkerClusterGroup while groupObjects is true.
  2. At the map's maximum zoom, spiderfy clusters whose members sit on
     the same point (or within a few meters). Do this without a second tap.
  3. Below max zoom, leave distance clustering as it is.
  4. Each spiderfied marker still opens its existing popup.

out:
  - src/features/map/components/cluster-map/ClusterMapVehicleLayer.tsx

done:
  - Two vehicles on one coordinate become separate markers at max zoom.
  - Zooming back out clusters them again.
  - A spread-out fleet still clusters below max zoom.
